# business-requirements/README.md– Enterprise Retail Data Platform

## 1. Business Context

A fictional multinational retail organization operates through physical stores, e-commerce platforms and distribution centers.

Business data is distributed across ERP, CRM, point-of-sale, warehouse management and digital commerce systems.

The organization requires a unified enterprise data platform to support operational intelligence, strategic decision-making, regulatory compliance and AI-enabled analytics.

## 2. Current-State Challenges

- Fragmented data across multiple business systems.
- Inconsistent customer and product identifiers.
- Duplicate records and conflicting business definitions.
- Delayed sales and inventory reporting.
- Limited end-to-end data lineage.
- Inconsistent data quality and governance controls.
- Manual financial reconciliation.
- Limited availability of reusable data products.

