## 6. Key Business Use Cases

### UC001 – Customer 360

Unify customer profiles, transaction history, loyalty information and consent preferences.

### UC002 – Omnichannel Sales Analytics

Analyze sales performance by channel, product, customer segment, geography and time.

### UC003 – Inventory Optimization

Identify inventory shortages, excess stock, inventory turnover and replenishment needs.

### UC004 – Supplier Performance

Measure supplier lead times, delivery accuracy and procurement costs.

### UC005 – Financial Reconciliation

Reconcile sales, payments, refunds and financial ledger postings.

### UC006 – AI-Enabled Demand Forecasting

Provide governed historical sales, inventory and promotion datasets for forecasting.

